{"case_id": "m42", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "openai__gpt-5.4-mini@low", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4-mini", "effort": "low", "group": "openai", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "The sequence is an arithmetic sequence with:\n\n- first term, \\(a = 3\\)\n- common difference, \\(d = 4\\)\n- number of terms, \\(n = 20\\)\n\n\\[\nT_{20} = a + (n-1)d = 3 + (20-1)(4) = 3 + 76 = 79\n\\]\n\nSum of first \\(20\\) terms:\n\n\\[\nS_{20} = \\frac{n}{2}(a + l)\n\\]\n\n\\[\nS_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}(3 + 79)\n\\]\n\n\\[\nS_{20} = 10(82) = 820\n\\]\n\n**Answer: \\(\\boxed{820}\\)**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 3.1, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 405, "output_tokens": 209, "reasoning_tokens": 46, "cost_usd": 0.001244, "served_models": ["openai/gpt-5.4-mini"], "hosts": ["OpenAI"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:28:57"}
{"case_id": "m44", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "openai__gpt-5.4-mini@low", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4-mini", "effort": "low", "group": "openai", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "\\[\nS_\\infty=\\frac{a}{1-r}\n\\]\n\nwhere  \n\\[\na=16,\\qquad r=\\frac{8}{16}=\\frac{1}{2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nS_\\infty=\\frac{16}{1-\\frac{1}{2}}\n=\\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{2}}\n=32\n\\]\n\n**Answer: \\(\\boxed{32}\\)**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.15, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 395, "output_tokens": 123, "reasoning_tokens": 28, "cost_usd": 0.00085, "served_models": ["openai/gpt-5.4-mini"], "hosts": ["OpenAI"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:28:57"}
{"case_id": "m45", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "openai__gpt-5.4-mini@low", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4-mini", "effort": "low", "group": "openai", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "\\[\n\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(2k+1)=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}2k+\\sum_{k=1}^{10}1\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=2\\sum_{k=1}^{10}k+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=2\\left(\\frac{10(11)}{2}\\right)+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=2(55)+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=110+10\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=120\n\\]\n\n**Answer: \\(\\boxed{120}\\)**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.6, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 446, "output_tokens": 157, "reasoning_tokens": 33, "cost_usd": 0.001041, "served_models": ["openai/gpt-5.4-mini"], "hosts": ["OpenAI"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:28:58"}
